# The flat that I rented in Russian: который in every case
subtitle: "Russian кото́рый in every case: кварти́ра, кото́рую я сняла́; парк, о кото́ром ты говори́ла. Masha shows Tom her new flat."
tags: ["russian","который","relative clauses","renting a flat","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/relative-clauses","vocabulary/renting"]
thumb: "band \"The flat that I rented\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"All of it in Russian: весь день, всё, что…","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/132-russian-all-of-it.cast"}

## The flat that I rented in Russian: который in every case
stress: new
level: basic
shuffle: true
